{
    "title": "Stock Car Racing",
    "description": "<p>\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Rev Up for Unmatched Racing Action!</strong> \ud83c\udfc1</p><p>Adrenaline-pumping oval track racing with a wide range of classes, race modes, tracks and adrenaline-fueled events. Customize your dream race car and battle for supremacy on the leaderboards in an expanded world of racing.\r\n</p><p><strong>New Class Event Races:</strong></p><p><strong>Dirt Racing Event:</strong> Kick up the dust in high-speed, vehicle-class restricted events on challenging dirt tracks.</p><p><strong>Stunt Truck Event:</strong> Defy gravity with monster jumps and stunts in our action-packed Stunt Trucks events.</p><p><strong>Open-Wheel Event:</strong> Experience the precision and speed of Open-Wheel racing, testing your skills in tightly contested races.\r\n</p><p><strong>More Cars, Tracks and Events:</strong></p><p>Explore close to 300 unique cars and now including specialized vehicles for Class Events.</p><p>Compete across 6 unique race tracks, with variations in surface and time of day and now including new environments perfect for dirt racing and open-wheel challenges.\r\n</p><p><strong>Your Favorite Race Modes, Now Even Better:</strong></p><p><strong>Multiplayer, Class Events, Championship, Regulation, Ladder, Endurance, Hot Lap,</strong> and <strong>more</strong> offer varied and challenging race experiences.\r\n</p><p><strong>Experience Enhanced Crash Damage:</strong></p><p>Race on meticulously designed oval and dirt racing tracks, feeling the car's limit with every turn.</p><p>Advanced crash physics for an even more immersive experience, complete with vehicle-damage, detachable-panels, sparks and smoke.</p><p>In-game cash system rewards your racing prowess, enabling purchases, upgrades, and customizations.\r\n</p><p><strong>Customize and Upgrade:</strong></p><p>Design your dream Stock Car or specialized event race car with custom colors, decals, and numbers.</p><p>Enhance your vehicle's performance with race upgrades for engine, tires, and chassis.\r\n</p><p><strong>A World of Racing Awaits:</strong></p><p>Join a vibrant racing community, competing against friends and racers globally on the Leaderboards</p><p>Compete in special race events including the Weekend Cup multiplayer event for bonus prizes\r\n</p><p><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong></p><p>Visually stunning 3D graphics bring your racing experience to life.</p><p>Realistic racing physics and race car assists ensure competitive and fun races for all skill levels.</p>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<p>\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Rev Up for Unmatched Racing Action!</strong> \ud83c\udfc1</p><p>Adrenaline-pumping oval track racing with a wide range of classes, race modes, tracks and adrenaline-fueled events. Customize your dream race car and battle for supremacy on the leaderboards in an expanded world of racing.<br></p><p><strong>New Class Event Races:</strong></p><p><strong>Dirt Racing Event:</strong> Kick up the dust in high-speed, vehicle-class restricted events on challenging dirt tracks.</p><p><strong>Stunt Truck Event:</strong> Defy gravity with monster jumps and stunts in our action-packed Stunt Trucks events.</p><p><strong>Open-Wheel Event:</strong> Experience the precision and speed of Open-Wheel racing, testing your skills in tightly contested races.<br></p><p><strong>More Cars, Tracks and Events:</strong></p><p>Explore close to 300 unique cars and now including specialized vehicles for Class Events.</p><p>Compete across 6 unique race tracks, with variations in surface and time of day and now including new environments perfect for dirt racing and open-wheel challenges.<br></p><p><strong>Your Favorite Race Modes, Now Even Better:</strong></p><p><strong>Multiplayer, Class Events, Championship, Regulation, Ladder, Endurance, Hot Lap,</strong> and <strong>more</strong> offer varied and challenging race experiences.<br></p><p><strong>Experience Enhanced Crash Damage:</strong></p><p>Race on meticulously designed oval and dirt racing tracks, feeling the car&#39;s limit with every turn.</p><p>Advanced crash physics for an even more immersive experience, complete with vehicle-damage, detachable-panels, sparks and smoke.</p><p>In-game cash system rewards your racing prowess, enabling purchases, upgrades, and customizations.<br></p><p><strong>Customize and Upgrade:</strong></p><p>Design your dream Stock Car or specialized event race car with custom colors, decals, and numbers.</p><p>Enhance your vehicle&#39;s performance with race upgrades for engine, tires, and chassis.<br></p><p><strong>A World of Racing Awaits:</strong></p><p>Join a vibrant racing community, competing against friends and racers globally on the Leaderboards</p><p>Compete in special race events including the Weekend Cup multiplayer event for bonus prizes<br></p><p><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong></p><p>Visually stunning 3D graphics bring your racing experience to life.</p><p>Realistic racing physics and race car assists ensure competitive and fun races for all skill levels.</p>",
